WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.416
Programa com IA o dia inteiro?

00:00:02.436 --> 00:00:04.018
Junte tudo numa janela só.

00:00:04.038 --> 00:00:06.549
A Rendra IDE reúne terminais em

00:00:06.569 --> 00:00:08.674
grade, o editor do VS Code e um

00:00:08.694 --> 00:00:10.462
explorador com as cores do Git.

00:00:10.482 --> 00:00:13.005
E mostra quanto cada projeto consome

00:00:13.025 --> 00:00:15.280
de tokens no Claude Code e no Codex,

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.685
com o custo calculado.

00:00:16.705 --> 00:00:18.160
Os limites de uso do plano

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.657
ficam sempre à vista.

00:00:19.677 --> 00:00:20.760
Tudo local:

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.779
sem conta, sem servidor e sem telemetria.

00:00:23.799 --> 00:00:25.404
Rendra IDE.

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:30.125
Código aberto, para Windows, macOS e Linux.
